This software embeds a snapshot (2026-11-17) of the STRchive disease tandem-repeat locus catalogue
(data/strchive_hg38.tsv, derived from data/STRchive-loci.json at https://github.com/dashnowlab/STRchive).
STRchive by Harriet Dashnow and contributors is licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Fields were selected and reformatted to TSV; values unchanged.
Citation: Hiatt L, et al. STRchive: a dynamic resource detailing population-level and locus-specific insights at
tandem repeat disease loci. Genome Medicine (2025). doi:10.1186/s13073-025-01454-4
